{"server":"cn","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_st03","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_st03","title":"法外之徒","storyCode":"CV-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"7fa6ef0025171c82bc2fc8ffd55d4704d2b8b649936666b5594dff28612f0d29","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"战争结束了，伍迪，你自由了。你可以回到拉特兰，回到那栋父母留给你的小房子，在门廊前种满玫瑰与月季......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然后，找一家附近的教堂，把它们绘在天顶上，倾听每一位来者的祷告，然后让这些声音伴你入梦，这样，你便能安眠一整晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在仓库里找到了你的铳，他的......实在是找不到了，伍迪，就带上它回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？你要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要留在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要留在哥伦比亚吗......可战争已经结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁伯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，你的战争结束了，我的才刚刚开始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，嘿，伍迪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我昏迷了多长时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些孩子看到我受伤了都很紧张，一时下手没轻重。你被推倒时脑袋撞在了阶梯上，当场就昏过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡她们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，她毫发无损。至于海伦娜女士，我派了人护送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"估计半个月后，她就能安然抵达那家赌场，将所有钱洗得干干净净，再交给那位早已等在拓荒地的西尔维娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你没让人去追吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，我一早就说了，我只关心合同上的事，上面要求我拖拽地块到指定的位置，并在拖拽期间维护地块治安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地块外的事情，里面没提到，我不关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，我是个冷血的混蛋，但我也不喜欢趴在别人的血肉上饱餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎么处置我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在哥伦比亚南部有一幢私宅，里面有一间很大的花房，是个好地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以更名换姓去那里安度晚年，我会安排好一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在那里住过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从没有，听房产商是这么跟我说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢你的好意，但房产商的话信不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你无意把我交给法庭，那我就要离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去找你的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去找我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的铳我放在了桌子上，半个月后有最后一列去往拓荒地的车队......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以先接电话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要喝茶吗，先生？一路赶来，真的辛苦了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，谢谢，杰西卡小姐。既然您的家族花费高薪将我雇佣，我理当竭诚为您服务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抢劫银行是重罪......这官司很难吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"分情况，不同的需求，不同的难度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您对监狱没有那么抗拒的话，我们会为您争取最短的刑期，舒适的环境，出来后没人会记得您所做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"这种事我们经常做，只要钱到位就没什么难度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，还有呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，很少有人想待在牢狱里面，我们还有另一套计划，您可以在家里面，或者某个风景秀美的别墅里待上一阵子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，也在当局的监视下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你们有难度吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"有，但不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您一天牢也不想坐，只想假装无事发生，立刻恢复正常的生活......很难，但不是不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在哥伦比亚，去监狱的罪犯其实很少，更多人是会被发往拓荒地的，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"您放心，杰西卡小姐......有我们在，结果不会糟糕到那个地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我是说自己想去拓荒地，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该在那里。我触犯了法律，这是我应付出的代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"您要我这样向布林雷先生回复吗，杰西卡小姐？对我来说，这才是最有难度的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......阻止我做想做的事情，才是最难的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为那是完完全全的......不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的律师","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"真是坚定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，很坚定......比以前的选择都要坚定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真不打算接？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，我从来没和任何人讲过，我真的很讨厌电话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其实能看出来，现在你的眉头能夹起一张纸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么明显吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，没错，每当电话响起，我只想举起铳将它射成筛子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想过无数次，但每一次，我都只能按捺下冲动，然后将它接起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一部电话而已......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟它在战场上待两个月，什么都变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从傍晚守到黎明，你一接起它，里面的声音说“进攻”。我只能听令，带着手下的士兵去冲锋陷阵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从黎明战斗至傍晚，你带着剩下的人回来，还来不及休息，电话又响了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里面的声音下令“守住阵地”，然后所有人返回前线，继续无穷无尽的斗争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就此分别吧，伍迪，如果我早已失去在你葬礼上致辞的资格，那么我希望你能答应我唯一的请求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别死在我不知道的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行，有句话留给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果回不了头，回个电话总是可以的，你也不必每次都被动地守着它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你永远记得这通电话。"},{"type":"narration","text":"拿起桌上的电话，他按下几个数字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，行长先生。我刚刚有些事情，没有接到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，拖拽期间出了些岔子。我明白您焦急的心情，但是对我来说，只要将地块带到指定位置，任务就算圆满结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他一切都算是小插曲，没人会在意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我明白，那笔钱对您很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您正在事业上升期，那些从特里蒙来的家伙会帮您更上一层楼。但是现在钱没了，我猜他们一定不会放过您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我知道您并不在乎他们。您头顶上有些更难对付的人，那些人才是真正决定您命运的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我理解，我都理解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，如果我能帮您补上那个漏洞呢？虽然不是小数目，但我掏得起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为回报，您或许也可以帮我个小忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些文件，希望您能签署，并在之后保密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您那边有人在敲门？对，看来我的佣兵们把文件送到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......您不敢签？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是次双赢的合作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半小时后我会再打一通电话给您，希望到时您已经考虑好了，回见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克里夫先生，钱款已经准备好了，只等那位行长先生做决定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是......我们前些日子拿下玻利瓦尔的平台时，可比这次顺利多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那毕竟是玻利瓦尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玻利瓦尔没有那位掀起风潮的科学家，也没有挤破头想抓住每个废弃地块的科技企业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不仅如此，玻利瓦尔在地块的价格和出让手续上也很爽快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟他们并不排斥和我们搞好关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，别抱怨事情不顺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和平的弦绷得越紧，弦两头的人就越想掌握能切断它的那把快刀。可一旦彻底砍断，那把刀要么快点抽身，要么就只能继续被握在手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经被一个比玻利瓦尔强大得多的家伙攥得太紧也太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想让那个大家伙稍微松一松手，甚至硌疼他，让他知道断了的弦意味着什么，我们以后还不知道要处理多少达维镇这样的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个他不屑放在眼皮下的老旧平台......啧，说不定它的作用比我们预计的更大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们只考虑最切近的影响，黑钢在玻利瓦尔和哥伦比亚东部边境设立的这两处训练中心，也确实能极大提升这些区域的治安水平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，如果连这些都不在乎，我们和那些只知道拿钱办事的家伙......不，和那些“大家伙”，又有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过那都是以后的事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那位行长打回来了，看来这个决定对他来说没那么难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要一起听吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们为什么要选在这个时候起航啊......我还想去送送杰西卡和伍德洛先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别抱怨啦，快来收拾你的衣服吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堆得满地都是......啧啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你们都不着急，杰西卡去了拓荒地，以后我们再见面就不知道是什么时候啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡的离职申请克里夫先生没有批准......就算去了拓荒地，她还是黑钢的员工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，可是她这次去拓荒地......是、是要服刑的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没错......带着黑钢员工的身份......和工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，去哪里也躲不掉的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不准哪天在拓荒地出任务，我们就得去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快把这一地的衣服收起来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么嘛......都瞒着我，我还以为以后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怪我们哦，谁让你们工程岗总是忙得不见人影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这是......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，我在衣服兜里摸到了一张字条。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大惊小怪。又不是钞票。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在半个月前，罗拉曾穿着那件外套，拥别了自己的朋友。\n那时她递给了对方一张字条，没有注意到对方其实也在她口袋里塞了一张字条。\n背过房间里其余两人，罗拉展开了那张字条。\n上面有几个数字，还有一段潦草的话：\n“如果缺经费，就打这个电话。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再来一轮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您已经在这个小酒馆坐一晚上了。老板都快打烊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我认识这里的老板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在等人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不等，这辈子不等人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是别人等您吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能等到您吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我的人可太多了，你说的哪一位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"远的不说，说近的，正等您的那位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能，一定能，我向别人打过包票，肯定是要去见的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这样重信重诺的人不多了，唉，我请您喝一轮吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟我这么久，就是为了请我喝一杯吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不管您信还是不信，我也向人打过包票，一定得让等您的那个女孩等到您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以叫我蒂拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g12_snowfield"},{"type":"narration","text":"在一片焦土中，我看见有火星亮起，随风飘向远方，重又湮灭为烟灰。\n抑或将夜幕灼烧，露出天光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的打算和我一起去拓荒地吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道你抛下的是什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚蠢的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，也许几年后，几个月后，甚至几天之后......我就会觉得，自己做了个愚蠢的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我只能依靠现在，只能依靠此时此刻的心去做出选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我现在觉得它值得孤注一掷，我就没有理由不付诸行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里真的会有你追逐的东西吗，杰西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前......我总是竭尽全力去追逐一些我根本追不上的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"童年时我试图追赶兄姊那比我还高的长腿，少年时祖父去世，我人在异地，又要追赶一场赶不及的葬礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长大后......我又在追赶一场场无法阻止的祸事与纷争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我永远在追赶，但永远也来不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次不一样，这次我不追了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为从一开始，我就会在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那便走吧，杰西卡，做好准备，在那里一切都要重新来过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不开心，杰西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的城堡倒了，花了一个下午，现在什么都没有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，你把城堡堆在沙滩上，它自然会被浪推倒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我太笨，没能给它找个安全的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看你的小脑袋瓜又在胡思乱想什么了？你是我的孙女，怎么可能会笨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是哥哥姐姐都比我聪明......比我懂的多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们都是成年人了，自然阅历要比你丰富，等你长大了，也会像他们一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那时他们不会更厉害吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦......你的怪问题怎么这么多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别沮丧了......让我和你一起把沙堡复原吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以吗......？可是就算复原了，明天还是会被波浪推倒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后......什么都没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，如果你害怕被浪花推倒，那我们就选一片离海水更远的沙滩，重建一座沙堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当一切都失去时，未来仍然存在......我们依然要对它抱有信心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖父","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要惧怕重新来过......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，那便重新来过吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一顶温暖的帽子被扣在女孩头上。帽檐很宽，几乎盖住她大半张脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想哭就哭出来吧......经历了这么多......想必也不好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要为哭泣而感到羞耻......杰西卡，新生都是从哭泣开始的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是呼吸的第一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默许久后，终于，一声啜泣从帽子下响起。\n老人没有低头看，而是将目光投向雪原的尽头。\n地平线处的天空被朝霞染红，倒映在光洁的雪地。\n那一片朱红色让他双目刺痛，几欲落下泪水。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
